# Trivy accepted-risk baseline — finance-sync container image
# =====================================================================
# Baseline recorded 2026-08-15 while adding the CI image-scan gate
# (task t_8675d5a3). All 23 entries are HIGH/CRITICAL findings present
# in the current image (python:3.12-slim-bookworm, Debian 12.15) that
# have NO fixed version available upstream yet (FixedVersion=N/A in the
# Trivy DB as of 2026-08-15) — mostly distro packages, plus one stale
# python-ecdsa advisory (CVE-2024-23342) already at the latest release.
#
# POLICY:
#  - The CI gate (Build & Push job) FAILS on any HIGH/CRITICAL finding
#    NOT listed here (exit-code: 1, severity HIGH,CRITICAL).
#  - Each entry carries an expiry so the baseline is re-reviewed when
#    it lapses; re-extend only if the finding still has no fix.
#  - Never add a NEW CVE here — new findings must be fixed, not ignored.
#
# Expiry format: "# expiry=\"YYYY-MM-DD\"" on the line above the ID.

# ── CRITICAL ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
